# overlay/profiles/appliance/packages.list — the DPorts packages of the
# headless profile.
#
# Copyright (c) 2026 The wtfbsd contributors. BSD-2-Clause (see LICENSE).
#
# One DPorts package name per line; blank lines and #-comments are
# ignored.
#
# The appliance needs no package beyond the base list: sshd is part of
# the DragonFly base system, so the build enables it through rc.conf(5)
# (sshd_enable). There is no sudo anywhere in this template: the
# privilege escalation is doas(1), which the base list brings.
#
# The names are not verified by this template (see the round report).
#
